        "line": 364,
        "text": "theorem W_formula (h : ℝ) {p : Point} (hp : p ∈ D.carrier) :\n    P.W h p = 1 - 2 * axialExponent h * p.2 * P.Ubar p -\n      coordinateFactor p.2 * parameterPartial P.Ubar p"
